XCOLOUR200 - Colour patch for COMMAND.COM 2.00 with out ANSI.SYS
X 
XSyntax:
X        DEBUG COMMAND.COM <COLOUR200.PAT
X 
XNote:
X        To change the colours for border, background, and foreground do the
Xfollowing.
X
X        A> DEBUG COMMAND.COM
X                E 234E 0x
X                E 2340 yz
X                W
X                Q
X
X        where x = border colour
X              y = background colour
X              z = foreground colour
e-o-f
