X 
XSyntax:
X        CSET
X 
XDescription:
X     CSET is a program which should be used to replace the CLS command in DOS.
XCSET is pre-configured for a certain colout combination.
X 
XFiles Used:
X        CSET.COM
X 
XNote:
X        To change the colours for border, background, and foreground do the
Xfollowing.
X
X        A> DEBUG CSET.COM
X                E 010D 0x
X                E 011B yz
X                W
X                Q
X
X        where x = border colour
X              y = background colour
X              z = foreground colour
